              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo ni bo ruvyaro rwa Shemu, nk’ukw imiryango yabo iri, nk’ukw indimi zabo ziri, uko bari mu bihugu vyabo, nk’ukw amahanga yabo ari.",
